WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:07.100
We are now learning something we many of us
worried about and suspected, which is that

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:14.320
millions of coronavirus vaccine doses are
what The Daily Beast is describing as likely

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:22.560
lost in the system of vaccine distribution,
although exactly what that means when you

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:30.140
have such malicious players involved as Trump
himself, Jared Kushner and others is a real

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.439
question.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:36.040
The Biden administration found out very quickly
when they took over that there really was

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.980
no plan for vaccine distribution.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:43.690
Despite all of the claims about we've got
the best generals and logistics in all of

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:51.300
this different stuff, there really was no
serious plan turned over to the Biden administration

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.570
for continued distribution of vaccines.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:58.950
And now it is appearing as though there are
millions of doses just missing and the answer

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.860
hasn't yet emerged.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:07.360
What we know is that according to data from
the CDC at the time of The Daily Beast's report

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:12.900
on this, forty one point four million doses
had been handed out to states and only twenty

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.870
one point eight million had been administered.

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:24.100
So that means there's 20 million doses in
theory given to states, but not yet administered.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:31.200
Officials say they believe there is a surplus
somewhere, but it's not clear how much of

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:35.280
a surplus there is, because even though you
hear those numbers, well, there must be 20

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.510
million doses sitting around.

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.510
States are saying we're out of vaccines.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:43.040
We don't know we don't know where these numbers
are coming from, but we don't have vaccines

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.040
sitting around.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.900
We're giving out doses in some cases almost
as quickly as they come in.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:54.210
So Biden's coronavirus task force members
went back and looked at the numbers again.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.229
They looked at local data.

00:01:55.229 --> 00:01:56.420
They looked at federal data.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:59.080
Here's what federal data says was given to
states.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.690
Here's what local data says they have.

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.869
And they looked at, is it a manufacturing
problem?

00:02:04.869 --> 00:02:06.330
Is it a shipping problem?

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.830
Is it a receiving problem?

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:11.389
Is it a waiting around to be administered
problem?

00:02:11.389 --> 00:02:14.999
What's in warehouses, what's in hospitals,
for example?

00:02:14.999 --> 00:02:17.469
They can't figure out what's going on.

00:02:17.469 --> 00:02:20.689
And every data set that they look at is missing
something.

00:02:20.689 --> 00:02:25.150
And then when they look at a data set from
a different source, it sort of overlaps.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:26.420
But it's inconsistent.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:28.189
It's incongruent.

00:02:28.189 --> 00:02:32.859
And what they've what they've chalked it up
to so far are what they are calling, quote,

00:02:32.859 --> 00:02:35.109
incredible inefficiencies.

00:02:35.109 --> 00:02:40.700
And I have to tell you that my suspicions,
my fears, I think is better said, ah, that

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:44.459
this is significantly worse than that.

00:02:44.459 --> 00:02:48.090
Were their lies told about availability by
the Trump administration?

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:49.090
Right.

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:54.090
And so what they claimed to have sent to states,
they didn't because there weren't actually

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:58.769
the numbers available that they claimed that
would be maybe incompetence and dishonesty,

00:02:58.769 --> 00:03:00.799
but not criminality.

00:03:00.799 --> 00:03:07.540
The other fear, of course, is were some of
these doses delivered to the federal government

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.579
and then something was done with them?

00:03:09.579 --> 00:03:14.169
I'm not saying Jared Kushner is selling doses
to who knows where.

00:03:14.169 --> 00:03:17.250
At least I don't have evidence of that at
this point in time.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:22.090
But is there some kind of skimming that has
been taking place at this point?

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:26.409
Everything is on the table because the numbers
just don't make sense.

00:03:26.409 --> 00:03:28.999
The numbers just don't add up.

00:03:28.999 --> 00:03:35.170
And right now, Biden administration officials
are taking the point of view that based on

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:44.189
what they know right now, it seems to be a
combination of shipping delays and kinks in

00:03:44.189 --> 00:03:45.189
reporting.

00:03:45.189 --> 00:03:49.580
So that here's an here's like the most benign
possible example.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:50.799
I'm making these numbers up.

00:03:50.799 --> 00:03:54.529
Texas gets 10 million doses on paper.

00:03:54.529 --> 00:03:57.469
Federal government says we gave you 10 million
doses.

00:03:57.469 --> 00:04:04.060
Texas gets them and then sends them right
back out to hospitals and hospitals, get the

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.950
10 million doses.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:10.579
But it takes them a while to report on the
number administered.

00:04:10.579 --> 00:04:18.389
So a hospital gets 100000 and they administer
80000 and they don't yet report that they've

00:04:18.389 --> 00:04:19.690
administered the eighty thousand.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.830
They just say, listen, we only see 20000 available
doses.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:26.580
The 80000 that were administered haven't yet
been reported as administered.

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:31.520
That would be like the most benign explanation
on the other side of it are really, really

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:38.789
horrible hypotheses about wrongdoing, malfeasance,
falsification of orders, skimming and all

00:04:38.789 --> 00:04:40.259
sorts of things that seem very.

00:04:40.259 --> 00:04:45.370
Jared Kushner, if you're familiar with his
track record as a landlord in New York City

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:53.050
in the New York City area, the other possibility
is that they didn't steal anything.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:57.810
But things have been lost or things have been
spoiled and they didn't want to come clean

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:58.810
about spoilage.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:04:59.810
We.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:04.960
Anecdotally of stories about a pharmacist
in I don't remember what state, maybe Wisconsin

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:08.830
or Michigan deliberately spoiled some doses
because he's some kind of anti boxer and he's

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.270
been charged.

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:16.509
We know about some number of doses, that cleaning,
I think it was in Boston, a cleaning person

00:05:16.509 --> 00:05:21.830
accidentally unplugged one of the freezers
that are used and a bunch of vaccines spoiled.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:28.660
And those there are reports of maybe there's
some bigger spoilage issue or loss issue and

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.479
it's not it's not being reported.

00:05:30.479 --> 00:05:31.830
I don't know.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:37.030
What it increasingly does seem like, though,
is that it's not that there are just millions

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.979
of doses sitting under a table somewhere.

00:05:39.979 --> 00:05:44.069
And any day now we're going to find them and
say, oh, the numbers all add up perfectly

00:05:44.069 --> 00:05:48.009
with every day that passes without answers
to what's going on.

00:05:48.009 --> 00:05:52.569
The idea that they're just going to find these
becomes less and less likely.

00:05:52.569 --> 00:05:58.409
So, you know, I'm not saying check the freezers
at Mar a Lago, but when it comes to the Trump

00:05:58.409 --> 00:06:03.690
administration and the dishonesty I wouldn't
put anything past them is the point.

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:06.919
And hopefully at some point we're going to
get some answers about what happened here.

00:06:06.919 --> 00:06:11.600
The good news is and if you watched yesterday's
Joe Biden press event with me, you saw Joe

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:17.180
Biden say that they are going to be upping
vaccine distribution from eight point six

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.789
million doses a week to 10 million doses a
week.

00:06:19.789 --> 00:06:23.569
That's going to get us closer, not quite to
one point five million per day, but in the

00:06:23.569 --> 00:06:28.680
one point two million area, we have the JMJ
one dose vaccine that is supposedly just a

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:33.060
week or so from presenting data to the CDC
and hopefully will get approval there.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:38.900
It is plausible and hopefully increasingly
likely that Joe Biden is right in what he

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:43.139
said yesterday, that during spring, anyone
who wants the vaccine will be able to get

00:06:43.139 --> 00:06:44.139
one.

00:06:44.139 --> 00:06:45.139
We're going to follow it.

00:06:45.139 --> 00:06:46.160
We've been following it and I'll keep you
posted.

